        <item>
            <title>iNotch 1.1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 25 Nov 2025 16:14:49 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h1>iNotch 1.1.2</h1>
                <h2>🐛 Bug Fixes</h2>
                <h3>Notch Display</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Fixed notch sizing on external displays</strong> - The notch now displays correctly on Macs without a physical camera notch or external displays, with proper rounded corners and appropriate sizing</li>
                    <li><strong>Improved notch width calculation</strong> - Default width adjusted from 985px to 185px for better compatibility</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Audio Spectrum</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Enhanced audio spectrum visibility</strong> - Improved gradient colors for better visibility on dark album art</li>
                    <li><strong>Fixed gradient direction</strong> - Audio spectrum now displays with white gradient from bottom to top for better visual appeal</li>
                    <li><strong>Better color handling</strong> - Audio spectrum now properly uses album art colors with automatic brightness adjustment for dark artwork</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>Music Player</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Fixed progress bar drag delay</strong> - Music progress bar now responds immediately when dragging or clicking, eliminating the previous delay</li>
                    <li><strong>Improved progress bar responsiveness</strong> - Enhanced real-time updates and smoother interaction</li>
                </ul>
                <h2>🎨 UI Improvements</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Smoother animations</strong> - Refined animation timing for audio spectrum bars</li>
                    <li><strong>Better visual feedback</strong> - Improved hover and interaction states</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
